    - Added UseIISExpress / IISExpressMicrosoftURL / IISExpressUserHomeApplication settings.
    - Preserved all original NuGet references, source includes, OutputType, and
      every other existing property and item group verbatim.
    - OutputType=Library is intentional — ASP.NET MVC 5 web applications compile to a
      class library; IIS (Express) loads the compiled assembly from bin\ at runtime.
