    {349c5851-65df-11da-9384-00065b846f21} = ASP.NET MVC 5 Web Application
    {fae04ec0-301f-11d3-bf4b-00c04f79efbc} = Windows Forms
    The first GUID is the one that matters for the "ASP.NET Web Application" personality.
  -->
